* Regarding the URL of the image - who will be able to access the contents of this URL? As a rider/driver - can I send it to my friends/random people?
** {color:#0747a6}Riders and Drivers will not have access to the URL of the image, nor will they be able to share it. Only Bolt will have access to it, internally.{color}
* Are we using the services of any third-parties for this feature?
** {color:#0747a6}Only for storing (we use AWS services for storing){color}
* Regarding push notifications - no comments there, I believe we can follow the same logic as we already have for in-app messages between Rider<>Driver.
** {color:#0747a6}Perfect{color}
